 пояснение — пара «бейдж + подпись» или [`Text`](../text/guidelines.md) / Plate.","source":"core/web/components/status-badge/guidelines.md:24","section":"Когда не использовать","route":"context-or-guidance","manualRuleIds":[],"compiledRuleIds":[]},{"sourceRuleId":"web-core.status-badge.hub.25","sourceNorm":"Нужна **уникальная** иконка или цвет вне канонического набора — в коде `customIcons` или сборка на [`IconView`](../icon-view/guidelines.md).","source":"core/web/components/status-badge/guidelines.md:25","section":"Когда не использовать","route":"context-or-guidance","manualRuleIds":[],"compiledRuleIds":[]},{"sourceRuleId":"web-core.status-badge.hub.26","sourceNorm":"Нужен индикатор **загрузки действия** — [`Spinner`](../spinner/guidelines.md), не StatusBadge.","source":"core/web/components/status-badge/guidelines.md:26","section":"Когда не использовать","route":"context-or-guidance","manualRuleIds":[],"compiledRuleIds":[]},{"sourceRuleId":"web-core.status-badge.hub.30","sourceNorm":"Выбирай **view** по смыслу из канонического набора (таблица ниже); не подбирай цвет и иконку вручную.","source":"core/web/components/status-badge/guidelines.md:30","section":"Основные правила","route":"partial-local-canonical-icon-lock; semantic View choice stays contextual","manualRuleIds":["component:web-core.status-badge.canonical-icon-identity"],"compiledRuleIds":["component:web-core.status-badge.canonical-icon-identity.1.1.1"]},{"sourceRuleId":"web-core.status-badge.hub.31","sourceNorm":"**Размер** — по контексту и плотности UI; в макете и коде согласуй один из пяти размеров: 16, 20, 24, 32, 40.","source":"core/web/components/status-badge/guidelines.md:31","section":"Основные правила","route":"context-or-guidance","manualRuleIds":[],"compiledRuleIds":[]},{"sourceRuleId":"web-core.status-badge.hub.32","sourceNorm":"**Палитра:** на светлой поверхности — `StatusBadge`; на инвертированной / тёмной — `StatusBadge_Inverted` (`colors=\"inverted\"` в коде).","source":"core/web/components/status-badge/guidelines.md:32","section":"Основные правила","route":"context-or-guidance","manualRuleIds":[],"compiledRuleIds":[]},{"sourceRuleId":"web-core.status-badge.hub.33","sourceNorm":"Один бейдж = один статус; не комбинируй несколько бейджей для одного объекта без явной задачи дизайнера.","source":"core/web/components/status-badge/guidelines.md:33","section":"Основные правила","route":"context-or-guidance","manualRuleIds":[],"compiledRuleIds":[]}],"gaps":[{"id":"NATIVE_NEW_BINDINGS","status":"NOT_RUN_USER_ONLY","detail":"Исторические Athena-снимки восстановили источник; свежая установленная Figma-проверка r2 ещё не выполнена."}],"correctionOf":"reports/draft-r1-2026-10-24/coverage-map.json","resolvedGaps":[{"id":"FIXED_GLYPH_IDENTITY","status":"RESOLVED_FROM_EXISTING_ATHENA_SNAPSHOT"}],"historicalR1SourcePins":[{"path":"/Users/alexkukhta/Desktop/workplace/shared/design-system_ab/JSONS/web/components/web-core/core/StatusBadge/contract.generated.json","sha256":"63281770c716420d05741f23cb8c022066980640c95443a6ee75b1912fb65061","bytes":288338},{"path":"/Users/alexkukhta/Desktop/workplace/shared/design-system_ab/JSONS/web/components/web-core/core/StatusBadge/contract.overrides.json","sha256":"f84113d0189100f3860323c981a2e9e533cf1c048573322ff1aa1be5400f37bc","bytes":1254},{"path":"/Users/alexkukhta/Desktop/workplace/shared/design-system_ab/JSONS/web/components/web-core/core/StatusBadge/rules.json","sha256":"289121f8072f35cb61e1bb97331765cf142721fddbb8debde8b986c9eec78596","bytes":2422},{"path":"/Users/alexkukhta/Desktop/workplace/shared/design-system_ab/JSONS/web/components/web-core/core/StatusBadge/composition-contract.json","sha256":"be2c35da2fc7ebd5e5e7faac66ba9a446cc3c896650051274a9d98aa73b3467a","bytes":1884},{"path":"/Users/alexkukhta/Desktop/workplace/shared/design-system_ab/JSONS/web/components/web-core/core/StatusBadge/agent-context.json","sha256":"9f54d6f35413fd70f044cb0f374fb844014a0e5eef083764875c0a2b27716498","bytes":4031},{"path":"/Users/alexkukhta/